@startuml

title Sequence Diagram for PDF Upload and Processing

actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant Redis
participant RAGEngine

User -> Frontend: Upload PDF File
Frontend -> Backend: POST /upload
Backend -> Backend: Validate File (extension, size, content)
alt Validation Fails
    Backend -> Frontend: Return Error Response
else Validation Succeeds
    Backend -> Redis: Set Status "uploading"
    Backend -> Backend: Save File to Disk
    Backend -> Redis: Set Status "processing"
    Backend -> Backend: Background Task - Process PDF
    Backend -> Frontend: Return Success Response
    Backend -> RAGEngine: Process PDF File
    RAGEngine -> Backend: Return Summary
    Backend -> Redis: Set Status "completed"
    Backend -> Redis: Save Summary
end

User -> Frontend: Check Status
Frontend -> Backend: GET /status/{filename}
Backend -> Redis: Fetch Status
alt Status Found
    Backend -> Frontend: Return Status and Summary
else Status Not Found
    Backend -> Frontend: Return Error Response
end

@enduml